{"seq":2,"slug":"capacity","title":"容量与细集：比测度更锐利的\"可忽略\"标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/capacity/capacity","wordCount":1571,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"容量与细集-比测度更锐利的-可忽略-标准\">容量与细集：比测度更锐利的&quot;可忽略&quot;标准</h1><p>在测度论里，&quot;零测集&quot;是标准的&quot;可以忽略&quot;的集合。但位势论里有一个更严苛、也更有物理意义的标准——零容量集。一个线段在三维空间里 Lebesgue 测度为零，一个点也是；可是从静电角度看，你能往一根导线上充电，却无法往一个几何点上充上任何有限电荷。容量正是捕捉这种差异的量：它衡量一个集合&quot;接住电荷、储存能量&quot;的本领，能看见测度看不见的精细结构。本篇讲清容量的定义、性质，以及被它判为可忽略的极集与随之而来的细拓扑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-容量的两种等价定义\">核心概念：容量的两种等价定义</h2><p>容量有多种等价定义，各有用处。以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\ge3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 的牛顿容量为例，设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 为紧集。</p>\n<p><strong>能量定义（变分）</strong>：在支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>、总质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率测度中，寻找能量最小者，容量是最小能量的倒数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><munder><mrow><mi>inf</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">supp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{cap}(K) = \\Big(\\inf_{\\mu:\\ \\operatorname{supp}\\mu\\subseteq K,\\ \\mu(K)=1} I(\\mu)\\Big)^{-1},\\qquad I(\\mu)=\\iint |x-y|^{2-n}\\,d\\mu\\,d\\mu.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.32em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">supp</span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">in<span style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.354em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.222em;vertical-align:-0.862em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.001em;\">∬</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>集合越&quot;大、越舒展&quot;，电荷越容易铺开、能量越低、容量越大；集合越&quot;瘦&quot;，电荷被迫挤在一起、能量越高、容量越小；瘦到极致（如一个点），最小能量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>，容量为零。</p>\n<p><strong>位势定义（平衡）</strong>：容量等于使平衡位势稳定时集合上能承载的总电荷（在电势归一的约定下），与下一篇 <a href=\"equilibrium-measure\">平衡测度</a> 直接相关。</p>\n<p>对一般（非紧）集合，用内/外逼近推广：内容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>sup</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{cap}_*(E)=\\sup_{K\\subseteq E}\\operatorname{cap}(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0816em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0893em;vertical-align:-0.3393em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">sup</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3393em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，外容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>inf</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>⊇</mo><mi>E</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>G</mi><mtext>开</mtext></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{cap}^*(E)=\\inf_{G\\supseteq E,\\ G\\text{开}}\\operatorname{cap}(G)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">in<span style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">f</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">开</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；对 Borel 集（可容集）两者相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量的性质-它不是测度\">容量的性质：它不是测度</h2><p>容量与测度形似而神异，最关键的差别是它<strong>不可加</strong>——它是次可加而非可加的。下表对照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>Lebesgue 测度</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单调性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E\\subseteq F\\Rightarrow \\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒≤</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E\\subseteq F\\Rightarrow \\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒≤</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可数次可加</td>\n<td>成立（且可加）</td>\n<td>成立（次可加，不可加）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平移不变</td>\n<td>成立</td>\n<td>成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times\\lambda^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times\\lambda^{n-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（牛顿）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点集</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线段（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{R}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>缩放律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{cap}(\\lambda K)=\\lambda^{n-2}\\operatorname{cap}(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 揭示容量的&quot;维数&quot;是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>——它对低维结构比 Lebesgue 测度敏感得多。正因如此，测度为零的线段仍有正容量，这一条差异后面直接决定布朗运动能否击中一个集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"极集-零容量的-真正可忽略\">极集：零容量的&quot;真正可忽略&quot;</h2><p>容量为零的集合称为<strong>极集</strong>（polar set）。它们是位势论里&quot;真正可以忽略&quot;的集合，地位类似测度论的零测集，但更强也更贴合调和结构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>极集必是 Lebesgue 零测集，但反之不然（正测度反而必非极）。</li>\n<li>极集上牛顿位势可以取到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>；一个位势&quot;发散的坏点集&quot;总是极集。</li>\n<li><strong>可去性</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 在开集去掉一个紧极集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 后调和且局部有界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 可调和延拓过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>——极集对调和函数&quot;不可见&quot;，像不存在一样。这与复分析里孤立可去奇点的 Riemann 定理同源，那里单点（平面上的极集）可被跨越，见 <a href=\"../../complex-analysis/series-residues/singularities-residues\">复分析 · 奇点与留数</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>极集刻画了 <a href=\"../boundary/dirichlet-problem\">Dirichlet 问题</a> 里&quot;边界坏点&quot;的确切大小：Perron 解取不到边界值的非正则点集，恰是一个极集——所以&quot;几乎所有边界点都正则&quot;（除一个容量零集外）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"细拓扑-让位势连续的最粗拓扑\">细拓扑：让位势连续的最粗拓扑</h2><p>极集导致一个反直觉的现象：位势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>U</mi><mi>μ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U^\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在通常的欧氏拓扑下可能不连续（在极集上跳到无穷）。为了让所有超调和位势都连续，Cartan 引入了<strong>细拓扑</strong>（fine topology）——它是使全体超调和函数连续的最粗拓扑，比欧氏拓扑更细（开集更多）。</p>\n<p>在细拓扑下，&quot;细连续&quot;&quot;细极限&quot;取代普通连续，许多在欧氏拓扑下失败的定理重新成立。一个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 在点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 处&quot;细稠密&quot;与否，由 <strong>Wiener 判则</strong>用一列几何缩小的环壳容量之和是否发散来判定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cap</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>x</mi><mtext> 是 </mtext><mi>E</mi><mtext> 的正则点</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{k} \\frac{\\operatorname{cap}\\big(E\\cap A_k\\big)}{\\operatorname{cap}(A_k)} = \\infty \\iff x \\text{ 是 } E \\text{ 的正则点}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8921em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.549em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的正则点</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这正是 Dirichlet 问题正则边界点的精确判据，把&quot;边界够不够胖&quot;翻译成&quot;环壳容量和够不够大&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  E[集合 E] --&gt; C{容量 cap E}&#10;  C --&gt;|=0| POL[极集&lt;br/&gt;调和函数可忽略]&#10;  C --&gt;|&gt;0| NON[非极&lt;br/&gt;可承载有限电荷]&#10;  POL --&gt; REM[可去奇点]&#10;  POL --&gt; IRR[Dirichlet 非正则点集]&#10;  NON --&gt; WIE[Wiener 判则&lt;br/&gt;环壳容量和判正则性]&#10;  C --&gt; FINE[细拓扑&lt;br/&gt;使位势连续的最粗拓扑]&#10;  C --&gt; PROB[布朗运动能否击中&lt;br/&gt;见 4_practice/1]\">flowchart TD\n  E[集合 E] --&gt; C{容量 cap E}\n  C --&gt;|=0| POL[极集&lt;br/&gt;调和函数可忽略]\n  C --&gt;|&gt;0| NON[非极&lt;br/&gt;可承载有限电荷]\n  POL --&gt; REM[可去奇点]\n  POL --&gt; IRR[Dirichlet 非正则点集]\n  NON --&gt; WIE[Wiener 判则&lt;br/&gt;环壳容量和判正则性]\n  C --&gt; FINE[细拓扑&lt;br/&gt;使位势连续的最粗拓扑]\n  C --&gt; PROB[布朗运动能否击中&lt;br/&gt;见 4_practice/1]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么容量是-正确-的度量\">为什么容量是&quot;正确&quot;的度量</h2><p>容量的每条特色都指向一个统一的答案：它是调和世界里的&quot;正确大小&quot;。测度问&quot;占了多大体积&quot;，容量问&quot;对调和函数的影响有多大&quot;。极集是调和函数看不见的集合，Wiener 判则是边界正则性的判据，细拓扑是位势连续的拓扑——三者都用容量而非测度来度量。最深刻的验证来自概率：一个紧集的牛顿容量为正，当且仅当从外部出发的布朗运动<strong>以正概率击中它</strong>；极集正是布朗运动几乎必然击不中的集合。这条等价把本篇抽象的容量概念钉在一个可想象的物理事实上，完整展开见 <a href=\"../practice/brownian-connection\">布朗运动的概率联系</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>容量衡量集合&quot;接住电荷、储能&quot;的能力，可用最小能量的倒数（变分）或平衡电荷（位势）等价定义。</li>\n<li>容量单调、次可加但不可加，缩放律为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda^{n-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，&quot;维数&quot;是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，对低维结构比测度敏感——测度零的线段仍有正容量。</li>\n<li>极集（零容量）是位势论真正可忽略的集合：必零测但更强，调和函数可跨其延拓（可去性），刻画 Dirichlet 非正则边界点。</li>\n<li>细拓扑是使位势连续的最粗拓扑；Wiener 判则用环壳容量和给出边界正则性判据。</li>\n<li>容量的&quot;正确性&quot;由概率验证：正容量 ⟺ 布朗运动以正概率击中，极集 ⟺ 几乎必然击不中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇（实现最小能量的测度）：<a href=\"equilibrium-measure\">平衡测度</a></li>\n<li>极集与非正则边界点的对应：<a href=\"../boundary/dirichlet-problem\">Dirichlet 问题</a></li>\n<li>跨库：容量作为集合函数与 Lebesgue 测度的对比见 <a href=\"../../real-analysis-measure/integration/lebesgue-measure\">实分析与测度 · Lebesgue 测度</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容量与细集：比测度更锐利的\"可忽略\"标准","id":"容量与细集-比测度更锐利的-可忽略-标准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：容量的两种等价定义","id":"核心概念-容量的两种等价定义"},{"level":2,"text":"容量的性质：它不是测度","id":"容量的性质-它不是测度"},{"level":2,"text":"极集：零容量的\"真正可忽略\"","id":"极集-零容量的-真正可忽略"},{"level":2,"text":"细拓扑：让位势连续的最粗拓扑","id":"细拓扑-让位势连续的最粗拓扑"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么容量是\"正确\"的度量","id":"为什么容量是-正确-的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"牛顿位势：由质量生成的场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/capacity/newtonian-potential"},"next":{"title":"平衡测度：电荷如何自己找到最省力的分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/capacity/equilibrium-measure"}}